# Unwilling Vessel (3/2 vigilance), "Eerie - Whenever an enchantment you control enters ..., put a possession counter on this creature.
# When this creature dies, create an X/X blue Spirit creature token with flying, where X is the number of counters on this creature":
# Bot2's Flood on turn 2 is not an enchantment Bot1 controls, so no counter; each of Bot1's two Floods on turn 3 puts one (two in all);
# Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 4 and a 2/2 blue Spirit with flying is made, X being the two counters it had as it died.

